caption: Priests

Priests can gain regular priestly spell magic, so long as their god knows and can cast that spell, and gives them permission to access it. A god must pay two points for a Priest to create the Mindlink, and will always hear the prayers of their priests. Priests have access to what GURPS calls Clerical magic, though they access it using Modular Ability slots, allowing them to swap out what spells they know with several hours of prayer.
